OL,3,A105-year-old investigated for crimes at
OL,4,ANazi PoW camp in Germany
OL,5,
OL,6,FGerman prosecutors are investigating a
OL,7,Fman aged 105 over allegations that he
OL,8,Fwas an accessory to multiple counts of
OL,9,Fmurder at a Nazi prisoner of war camp
OL,10,Fin World War Two.
OL,12,FThe suspect is alleged to have been a
OL,13,Fcamp guard at Stalag 326 VI K in Senne
OL,14,Fin northwestern Germany.
OL,16,FA similar case had also been under way
OL,17,Finvolving a second former camp guard at
OL,18,FSenne, Dortmund public prosecutor Sonja
OL,19,FFrodermann said in a statement.
OL,21,FThat suspect died a few months ago at
OL,22,Fthe age of 99, she said.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
